   "questiontext_html": "<p><code>L.index(x)</code> tells you where the <b>first</b> <code>x</code> is in a list. Here we want the <b>last</b> place where <code>x</code> appears.</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:2px 0;margin:6px 0 4px\"><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace\">L =</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">9</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:rgb(65,149,209);color:#fff;border-radius:2px\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:5px 7px;white-space:nowrap;font-family:monospace;font-size:14px;background:#e2e6ea;color:#8a939c;border-radius:2px\">7</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding-right:10px\"></td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">0</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">1</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">2</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">3</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">4</td><td style=\"text-align:center;padding:1px 6px;font-size:12px;color:#8a939c\">5</td></tr></table><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a939c;margin:0 0 10px\">the last 4 is at index 4</div>\n<p><b>Hint:</b> loop over the